WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:09.900
Trying to find which egg produces the chicken you want?
Skip static charts. Use the game's live evidence.

00:00:09.900 --> 00:00:20.500
Open Flock, choose Index, find the chicken, and hover over its card.
Recorded gameplay shows the source egg there.

00:00:20.500 --> 00:00:30.500
Next, check the egg's visible pool and rarity information.
These live fields can change after updates, so recheck them.

00:00:30.500 --> 00:00:40.250
The official description confirms the main loop: hatch eggs to collect chickens,
while your chickens can keep laying eggs when you are offline.

00:00:40.250 --> 00:00:54.850
Rewards need caution. Recorded gameplay shows joining the official community,
then Rewards and Community, but the reward can rotate. An event drop is only an example.

00:00:54.850 --> 00:01:07.480
Before spending, verify the target, source egg, visible pool or rarity, and your goal.
No fixed complete list is claimed here. Use the evidence guide at Game Hint Lab.
